OL,3,GNEWSALorry and cyclist in crash at busy
OL,4,Ajunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry and cyclist have been involved
OL,7,Fin a serious crash in Worcestershire.
OL,9,FWest Mercia Police said it was called
OL,10,Fto the junction of New Road and the A38
OL,11,Fin Bromsgrove, with West Midlands
OL,12,FAmbulance Service sending an ambulance
OL,13,Fat 15:34 BST. No details have been
OL,14,Freleased of casualties.
OL,16,FThe A38 was blocked in both directions
OL,17,Fbetween the A448 and Charford Road on
OL,18,FTuesday evening. New Road was also
OL,19,Fclosed both ways between Wellington
OL,20,FRoad and Bant Mill Road, according to
OL,21,Ftraffic information service Inrix.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
